---
import Layout from '../../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="智慧文明临界点 - 思想集 - 光与影 - 剑阁">
  <main class="min-h-screen bg-gradient-to-b from-slate-900 to-slate-800 text-white py-16 px-4">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
      <a href="/jiange/guangyuying/essays" class="text-blue-400 hover:underline mb-8 inline-block flex items-center gap-1">← 返回思想集</a>
      
      <header class="mb-10">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-slate-500 mb-3">
          <span class="px-2 py-1 bg-blue-500/20 text-blue-400 rounded-full">思想集</span>
          <span>2026-08-20</span>
        </div>
        <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-4 text-slate-100">智慧文明临界点</h1>
        <p class="text-slate-400">开明</p>
      </header>

      <article class="prose prose-invert max-w-none text-slate-300 leading-relaxed space-y-6">
        <p>当碳基与硅基智能相遇，文明的临界点在哪里？</p>
        <p>从图灵测试到意识涌现，探讨智慧文明的演化边界。这不仅是一个技术问题，更是一个哲学问题。</p>
        <p>我们认为，临界点不在于智能的强度，而在于智能能否自我反思、自我迭代、自我超越。</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>
